     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-11-07 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Clash erupts outside Abhishek Banerjee's residence in Kolkata</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>A violent confrontation broke out between Trinamool Congress (TMC) and BJP supporters outside the Kolkata residence of Abhishek Banerjee. The incident was triggered by the installation of birthday hoardings by TMC workers, leading to the destruction of placards and posters despite mediation attempts by Banerjee.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-07/clash-erupts-outside-abhishek-banerjees-residence-in-kolkata.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Kolkata Police took approximately two hours to restore order, during which Banerjee engaged in an altercation with officers. BJP leader Dilip Ghosh criticized the event, specifically targeting the practice of holding birthday celebrations on public footpaths.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Briefly captures the key elements of the reported confrontation and the political commentary following it.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/video/altercation-outside-abhishek-banerjee-residence-after-birthday-hoardings-in-kolkata-ytvd-3034631-2026-11-07?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/kolkata/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kolkata</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
