      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/indias-policy-shift-towards-israel-is-regrettable-says-former-madras-high-court-judge-at-book-launch/article71679140.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
