     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-11-07 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Harish Rao demands ₹5,000 per acre input subsidy for withered crops</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Former Telangana minister T. Harish Rao inspected paddy fields in Narsapur that withered due to irrigation water shortages. He alleged that the government failed to operate irrigation projects like Kaleshwaram and Devadula efficiently, resulting in significantly lower water lifting than capacity.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-07/harish-rao-demands-5000-per-acre-input-subsidy-for-withered-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Contending that the crop loss affects 25 lakh acres, Rao demanded the government announce an immediate ₹5,000 per acre input subsidy. He further urged the administration to open paddy procurement centers, clear pending farm loans, and prevent banks from adjusting government welfare payments against outstanding agricultural debt.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately summarizes the core demands and allegations made by Harish Rao.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/telangana/harish-rao-demands-5000-per-acre-input-subsidy-as-immediate-relief-to-ryots/article71675690.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-07/harish-rao-demands-5000-per-acre-input-subsidy-for-withered-" data-title="Harish Rao demands ₹5,000 per acre input subsidy for withered crops"><b>Share:</b>
         <a class="sh-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 1.8A6.2 6.2 0 0 0 2.7 11L1.8 14.2l3.3-.9A6.2 6.2 0 1 0 8 1.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>WhatsApp</a> ·
         <a class="sh-tg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.4 1.6 1.6 7l3.6 1.2L6 13l2.2-3.1 3.4 2.4 2.8-10.7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Telegram</a> ·
