     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-11-07 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Kerala Government Plans Central Forensic Lab in Thiruvananthapuram</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Kerala government informed the High Court that it is establishing a Central forensic science laboratory in Thiruvananthapuram. Authorities will provide 12,000 sq ft of land on lease near Technopark for the facility. Until the permanent lab is constructed, the government will utilize space at the Rajiv Gandhi Centre for Biotechnology.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-07/kerala-government-plans-central-forensic-lab-in-thiruvananth.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This development follows a petition by the Kerala State Legal Services Authority regarding the high pendency of narcotics cases caused by a shortage of state forensic labs. The court has scheduled the matter for further hearing on November 12.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurate summary of the government's response to the High Court regarding the forensic lab.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/steps-initiated-to-set-up-central-forensic-science-lab-at-thiruvananthapuram-keralam-govt-informs-hc/article71670756.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/thiruvananthapuram/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Thiruvananthapuram</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-07/kerala-government-plans-central-forensic-lab-in-thiruvananth" data-title="Kerala Government Plans Central Forensic Lab in Thiruvananthapuram"><b>Share:</b>
