     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-11-07 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Rashmika Mandanna Celebrates One Year of 'The Girlfriend', Thanks Fans</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Rashmika Mandanna</span> <span>#The Girlfriend</span> <span>#Bollywood</span> <span>#Anniversary</span></div>
       <p>Actress Rashmika Mandanna has commemorated the one-year anniversary of her film 'The Girlfriend', reflecting on her experience portraying the character Bhooma. Taking to Instagram Stories, Mandanna shared a heartfelt note expressing her profound gratitude to audiences for their enthusiastic response to the film and the enduring affection they have shown towards her character. This milestone prompted the actor to acknowledge how the film's journey has resonated with her personally, highlighting the numerous messages and personal experiences viewers have shared since its release.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-07/rashmika-mandanna-celebrates-one-year-of-the-girlfriend-than.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>In her Instagram note, Mandanna wrote, &quot;One year of The Girlfriend.. one year of Bhooma.. and a whole lot of love that I don’t think I’ll ever be able to put into words. What has made this journey even more beautiful is YOU GUYSSS. The messages, the conversations, the stories you’ve shared with me, the way you’ve shown your love for Bhooma, accepted her and made her a part of your lives.&quot;</p><p>Mandanna specifically thanked viewers for sharing their thoughts and experiences, emphasizing that their feedback made the entire journey particularly meaningful for her. Her portrayal of Bhooma in 'The Girlfriend' became a significant role within her filmography. The anniversary post served as an occasion for her to revisit the film and publicly acknowledge the audience's reception of her performance.</p><p>Beyond merely marking the release date, Mandanna’s message highlighted the continued importance of her connection with the character. She utilized the occasion to extend thanks to fans who have remained connected with Bhooma and conveyed the personal significance of the character to them.</p><p>What to watch: Upcoming projects from Rashmika Mandanna and fan engagement.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Faithfully captures Rashmika Mandanna's Instagram post marking one year of 'The Girlfriend' and playing Bhooma.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/south-cinema/rashmika-mandanna-celebrates-one-year-of-the-girlfriend-thanks-fans-for-their-love-for-bhooma/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
