       <h1>Students Launch Indefinite Hunger Strike at Kalady Sanskrit University</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Students at Sree Sankaracharya University of Sanskrit in Kalady, Kerala, have intensified protests over ongoing campus infrastructure and academic resource issues. Three students have been on an indefinite hunger strike since November 2 to demand immediate action from university administration.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-07/students-launch-indefinite-hunger-strike-at-kalady-sanskrit-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The demonstrators are calling for the urgent appointment of teachers to fill vacant faculty positions alongside improvements to basic campus facilities. The protest highlights longstanding grievances regarding the quality of academic resources and the overall infrastructure available to the student body at the institution.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is accurate and adheres to the provided source text without adding unnecessary fluff.</p>
